[en.FOCUS_C18_100_ZHEN]
Zhen

[en.FOCUS_C18_100_ZHEN_desc]
Zhen, Yang under Yins, showing a trend of uprising. Undoubtedly, our current world is occupied by the evils and the dark clouds have covered the sky. Although the Kirins love peace, they are not afraid of fighting.\n“The one to shock all, nothing is faster than thunder. The thunder shocks everything, and then it sparks fire.”\nThe reverse Kirin is a curse, but also a protection from our ancestors: in times of danger, we will become more united, more fierce, stronger, faster and braver.\nRain Shine warned us to prepare for the upcoming §Cwar§!. Although we are not yet clear who our enemies will be, it may be necessary to listen to the teachings of the leader.\nIf the world’s friendliness to us is hypocritical, then we will respond in the same way. Let our flame cleanse everything, and the Kirins will live forever on the ashes.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_ZHEN]
震

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_ZHEN_desc]
震，阳在阴下，而成奋起之势。毫无疑问，如今的世界阴邪横行，乌云遮蔽了天空，虽然麒麟们爱好和平，但也不惧争斗。\n“动万物者，莫疾乎雷。雷速而震动万物，雷激发而生火。” \n逆麟即是一种诅咒，也是祖先对我们的护佑：在危难之时，我们会变得更加团结，更加凶狠，更加强大、迅速、勇敢。\n雨晴警告我们为即将到来的§C战争§!做好准备，虽然我们尚不清楚我们的敌人，但或许聆听领袖的教导是有必要的。\n如果世界对我们的友好是虚伪的，那么我们也会以同样的方式回应。让烈火焚尽一切，而麒麟族将在灰烬之上永存。

